==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|grc|σκληρός||hard}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{rhymes|en|ɪərə}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|s|sclerae|scleræ}}

# {{lb|en|anatomy}} The white of the [[eye]]. It is the tough outer coat of the eye that covers the [[eyeball]] except for the [[cornea]].

====Synonyms====
* {{l|en|sclerotic}}
* {{l|en|sclerotic coat}}

